# ort-server default operator set (the musl releases from 0.4.0-musl): the curated set
# (curated.required_operators.config, 60 entries, unchanged) widened with every operator these models need,
# each converted with onnxruntime 1.31.1 convert_onnx_models_to_ort --optimization_style Runtime:
#   - knowledgator/gliclass-edge-v3.0 (export cnmoro/gliclass-edge-v3.0-onnx @1167c26)
#   - knowledgator/gliclass-modern-base-v3.0 @ac36922 (exported with gliclass 0.1.17, torchscript, opset 14)
#   - knowledgator/gliclass-modern-large-v3.0 (export cnmoro/gliclass-modern-large-v3.0-onnx @183d306), the
#     graph shape of the older gliclass exporter for the modern family
#   - SupersonicLabs/Julia-1 (export SupersonicLabs/Julia-1-ONNX @82a2fad, decision head)
#   - convaiinnovations/laya (export onnx-community/laya-ONNX @42e2a6e, decision head)
#   - LiquidAI/LFM2.5-Encoder-350M-Prompt-Router (export lemonade-sdk/LFM2.5-Encoder-350M-Prompt-Router-ONNX
#     @7d7035b, the zero-shot-classification model of upstream 0.4.0)
#   - the test/fixtures models (tiny-router, tiny-image)
# 77 operator entries. Build: tools/ort-musl-build.sh <arch> ops/default.required_operators.config <dir>
